- Logged-in users now start directly at `MainScreen` (no intermediate routing)
- The deeplink navigation happens much faster (100ms vs 300ms)
- The navigation flow is now consistent between normal app opening and deeplink opening

The blank screen was occurring because the app was showing `LocationScreen` briefly before navigating to the deeplink destination, which created an unnecessary visual interruption."}]}]}

